6. **Purpose and Effect**:
   - The purpose of the `testcase` mechanism is to:
     - Mark the beginning of a new logical test case within a test suite.
     - Notify the runner (test execution engine) of the start of a new test case, so that results (pass/fail/log) are attributed to the correct case.
